TryFStar

The F* and Pulse tutorial sources and static book originate from the
FStarLang/FStar website/tutorial/book tree:
https://github.com/FStarLang/FStar
Existing copyright and license notices are retained in the copied files.

The PAL example includes material from FStarLang/pal:
https://github.com/FStarLang/pal
Its MIT license is retained in website/examples/pal/LICENSE.pal.

The PAL-CSharp insertion-sort example includes material from
FStarLang/pal-csharp:
https://github.com/FStarLang/pal-csharp
Its MIT license is retained in website/examples/pal-cs/LICENSE.

F*, Pulse, PAL, PAL-CSharp, and the remaining development tools are installed
from their upstream releases or repositories when building the container.
They retain their upstream licenses.
